<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Mr.&nbsp;Jerry Qian Wang, Chief Financial Officer
of ZKH, added, &ldquo;The second quarter marked an important milestone in our earnings trajectory, as we achieved operating profitability
