losses and showed considerable sequential improvement. Looking ahead, we enter the second half of 2026 in a stronger financial position,
and remain confident in our ability to deliver sustainable and profitable growth over the long term.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

